      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-green-400">Pros</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ 25 years operating since 2000 — among the longest European VPS track records</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ 4 EU datacenter locations (NL/DE/LT/SE) for true GDPR data-residency</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ ISO 27001 + SOC 2 + PCI DSS certified across all 6 regions</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Dual cloud + bare-metal product lines on AMD EPYC + Intel Xeon</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ 1TB free egress traffic on every plan; overage only $0.5/TB</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Cloud VPS from $3.51/mo entry — competitive for a regulated-SMB provider</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ 8-minute average provisioning — full self-service, no sales-engineering contact</li>
